The exact blade-surface audit is progressing through rising spin and will then run X-slash. The acceptance logic now uses triangle overlap plus nearest-surface distance for the head and actual blade-surface distance for 22,766 groom control samples per frame; the older cylindrical proxy remains in the JSON only as a documented conservative comparison, not as the pass/fail criterion.
